  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, garlic, berbere spice, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add oyster meat to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated meat onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush the grill grates with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
